      "match_notes": "In a rain affected game reduced to 20 overs a side, Roche won the toss and elected to field first, Saltash scoring 99-9 from their 20 overs, S Hunt top scoring with 31 for Saltash. D Jeffery 4-34. H Trethewey 2-13 and P Trethewey 2-15 with the wickets for Roche.<br>In reply Roche made a slow start on a difficult batting track, reaching 25-1 off their first 10 overs before some late hitting from P Theunissen (56 n/o) sealed the win with 3 balls to spare, supported by T Rowe with a steady 21.",
